// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Angus McQueen 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4184466549" "Angus McQueen"
// ProfessionString :
"P273438047" "FBI Agent"
// DescriptionString :
"P960710659" "Angus McQueen was the best and brightest FBI agent in years. He was given the task of infiltrating the group of homeless known as the Lost to determine what was affecting their minds. After almost a year under, Angus was almost completely converted, but his iron will allowed him to wrench himself free and report back. It took many months of debriefing and reconditioning, but Angus can now share his intimate knowledge of this terrifying Rikti process with the heroes of Paragon City."
// HelloString :
"P856719880" "Greetings."
// HelloString :
"P3150180957" "This is a new day for me as well..."
// HelloString :
"P3225091688" "Happy to see you."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P653562412" "{LastContactName} is the one you need."
// FirstVisitString :
"P709206828" "It is well to be working with you. Let us begin without delay."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2922074786" "I don't have anything more for you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P4244318698" "You have tasks outstanding."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P42090887" "I have something for Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P804546750" "I have acquired more <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> for you...friend. Please, call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4289668869" "You are most skilled, {HeroName}. Here are more <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3399882546" "Time for you to help others, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
"P1403482863" "Founders' Falls"
// IntroString :
"P3013316640" "Angus McQueen is an FBI agent who the Rikti attempted to convert while he was investigating their organization. He has more information on the Rikti that no one can match...or confirm. He also has Relic, Focus, Gadget, Invention, and Genetic Alteration Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P14525397" "Choose Angus McQueen"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3547933746" "Angus was not unaffected by the Rikti, but he managed to resist a transformation that few have been able to."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P897441820" "One of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts</A> wishes to meet you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3242756621" "Some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts</A> of mine wish an introduction."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


