// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Janet Kellum 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1805479651" "Janet Kellum"
// ProfessionString :
"P3113651588" "FBSA AGENT"
// DescriptionString :
"P2566695285" "Janet Kellum had one of the highest scores in the history of the Federal Bureau for Super-powered Affairs entrance exam. Her partner, Maxwell Christopher, thinks that she has her head too far in the clouds sometimes, but there is no denying that the progress she's made into the Crey investigation is astounding. Janet is fond of her gruff partner, but envies the fact that his seniority allowed him to select Nemesis duty for himself."
// HelloString :
"P3701908332" "We have work to do."
// HelloString :
"P2127512284" "The countess is starting to sweat."
// HelloString :
"P2816494256" "Let's go after the countess. Everyone else has, but we'll be the ones to get her!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P665172553" "I think you mean to be speaking to {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P381894120" "Countess Crey is one of the most insidious villains operating in Paragon City today. You and I are going to bring her down!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2148755452" "I don't have anything more for you. Perhaps your other contacts have something?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P570402265" "You need to finish some of the things you already have on your plate, {HeroName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2665561059" "I have something, but it's classified for Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4282193286" "You do good work, friend. Try out these new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> and let me know what you think. Call me if there's anything else you need."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3066636616" "We're getting close to toppling Crey, I can feel it. Take all the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> you can use."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P873129178" "It was good working with you."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3865588257" "Janet Kellum is a brainiac FBSA agent. I have heard that she is high on Countess Crey's hit list. She likes working with science heroes, and she has access to Invention and Genetic Alteration Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P363512244" "Choose Janet Kellum"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P880279840" "Janet won't steer you wrong. Just watch your step, because she's determined to go after the countess."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4101035596" "One of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts</A> would like to meet you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3672956856" "Some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts</A> of mine have been angling for an introduction."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


