// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Madeleine Casey 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4091663708" "Madeleine Casey"
// ProfessionString :
"P1213781935" "Soap star"
// DescriptionString :
"P1302987756" "Madeleine Casey isn't a super-powered hero, but she plays one on TV. Madeleine is the face of Live Wire, the feisty electrical blaster on the popular soap opera, The Super Days. Her viewers have a lot of faith in her, and every once in a while she receives a fan letter that requires a truly heroic response. If there's one thing Madeline hates, it's letting a fan down. She can't hit the streets as Live Wire, but she can call upon one of her many hero friends to save the day. Madeline spends a lot of time networking, and she's become quite adept at pumping her contacts for information about the nefarious goings-on in Paragon City. She's come to think of the primped and polished media darling as her secret identity; the real Madeleine, she feels, is a wily snoop who truly has the heart of a hero."
// HelloString :
"P3067973836" "Glad to see you, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P4245234598" "I have some excellent leads."
// HelloString :
"P784888722" "Let's get to work!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2550299586" "You can't possibly be mistaking me for {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3342302304" "This troupe of entertainers calling themselves the Carnival of Shadows are more than they seem, {HeroName}; I'm sure of it."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1873377878" "I'm all out of info, {HeroName}. Keep up the good work with your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1077200091" "I think you have some work to finish up, {HeroName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2568885716" "I have some things lined up, but I think they are more suited to a hero with Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3034537850" "I am happy to help out my hero friends with <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> when I can. Please call me anytime."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2555585203" "You are one of the best Paragon City has to offer. Here are some more <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P663204818" "You've probably heard of Madeleine Casey, {HeroName}. Don't let her job as a television soap star fool you. When it comes to the Carnival of Shadows, she has the early dirt. She loves to work with heroes, especially ones skilled with magic. Madeleine can provide Relic and Focus Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P264998275" "Choose Madeleine Casey"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1601057489" "Madeleine really is a 'Live Wire!'"
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


