// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Maxwell Christopher 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P304146395" "Maxwell Christopher"
// ProfessionString :
"P1974235132" "FBSA Agent"
// DescriptionString :
"P2882698538" "Maxwell Christopher is from Missouri, as the joke around the Federal Bureau for Super-powered Affairs headquarters goes. His 'show me' attitude helps keep his feet, and those of his partner, Janet Kellum, on the ground. He took the Nemesis end of the investigation and made certain that Janet focused on the Crey. The legendary aspect of Nemesis and his fantastical devices don't impress Maxwell in the least."
// HelloString :
"P1643900886" "Hey, I got some details for ya."
// HelloString :
"P1123319149" "This Nemesis guy is tough nut to crack."
// HelloString :
"P3395816113" "I am making progress."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2062740259" "You want {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1286098669" "Glad to have you on board. Keep your eyes on the prize and we will get along fine. Nemesis needs to go down."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1176981658" "I have nothing for you. Try one of your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3986180417" "All I have are Security Level {Level} tasks."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3105913150" "Nice work, pal. Take a look at these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</A> And while you're at it, take my private number."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1373261398" "You do good work, {HeroName}. These new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> should help you out."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2244115842" "You need to move on to other troubles. Thanks for your help against Nemesis."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2880156047" "If you are looking for someone who has information on Nemesis, you should speak to Maxwell Christopher. He is a high level FBSA agent. Maxwell has access to Invention and Gadget Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2675847213" "Choose Maxwell Christopher"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2605309360" "Mister Christopher is a good agent, even if he is a bit gruff."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2679396721" "An <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>associate</A> of mine asked me to send you around."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3922094938" "Some of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts</A> are interested in speaking to you."
